  "description_text": "Welcome to 8019 S May! Beautifully and tastefully remodeled 5-bedroom, 2-bath home featuring a spacious family room and quality renovations throughout. Completely updated from top to bottom with no detail overlooked. Enjoy the added convenience of a brand-new 2-car garage. Located in Chicago's Gresham neighborhood, this home offers convenient access to neighborhood schools, nearby parks and recreational facilities, local shopping, restaurants, and public transportation. Nearby outdoor destinations include Dawes Park, Grove Park, and Mahalia Jackson Park. A great opportunity to enjoy a spacious, move-in-ready home in an established Chicago neighborhood. Nothing to do but move in and enjoy!",
