  "description_text": "This exceptional two-story residence in Chicago's Calumet Heights stands as a testament to meticulous care and timeless value. Situated on a prominent corner lot, the property makes an immediate impression with striking curb appeal and a presence that reflects the deep pride of ownership found throughout this quiet residential enclave. Known for its beautifully maintained blocks and peaceful atmosphere, this neighborhood offers a unique sense of place that is increasingly hard to find. Step inside to a main level defined by a bright and inviting living room. Expansive windows flood the space with natural light, creating a warm, airy environment that feels both spacious and welcoming. The heart of the home is a generous eat-in kitchen, offering plenty of room for dining and gathering. The main floor also features a dedicated laundry area, a full bathroom, and a flexible bedroom that functions perfectly as a guest space or a quiet home office. The second level hosts two additional bedrooms and a second full bathroom, ensuring a functional and well-balanced layout. Practicality meets comfort with the inclusion of zoned heating, allowing for tailored temperature control across the home. Outside, the property truly shines. The large backyard is a private retreat designed for versatility-whether you envision vibrant summer gatherings, a cozy fire pit setup, lush gardening projects, or simply lounging on patio furniture under the open sky. A one-car garage adds the final touch of convenience to this well-maintained gem. This is a rare opportunity to secure a quality home in a premier Chicago location. Schedule your private showing today to experience the charm of Calumet Heights firsthand.",
